"""
probe_and_index_card_mechanic_v2.py — schema-honest version

v1 used my placeholder vocabulary. v2 honors the REAL simplyBuddy deck:
  lanes  = mobiius | tinybox | doinbetter | research
  suits  = clubs | hearts | diamonds | spades | jokers | quantum
  phase  = Phase 1..8 with Hebrew anchors (AYIN_OR, DIBBUR, YAD, FOLD,
           COMBO_1, COMBO_2, YADA_DAAT, ETERNAL) and frequency_hz
  decks  = Kernel & Projection | Ethics & Safety | Provenance & Ledger |
           Twine Lab | Ingest | Mesh & Ops | Divergent Resonances

Inside-out rule still holds:
  - emit envelope first (matches real schema)
  - infer slots only when evidence is unambiguous
  - emit slot_proposal when uncertain (no fake certainty)
"""
from __future__ import annotations
